# Schema migrations are checksummed at boot (internal/storage/database/migrations/README.md): keep them, and the
# checksum golden, byte-identical on every checkout instead of letting core.autocrlf add CRs on Windows.
*.sql text eol=lf
*.golden text eol=lf
# Shell scripts run under bash on Linux (CI, the Postgres init scripts), where a CR from a Windows checkout breaks
# every line.
*.sh text eol=lf
